From e94d78cca9637ef8201ec734c4d3544d8c813a6e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: woahwhattheheck <293286387+woahwhattheheck@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 04:43:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] obs-frontend-api: Add scene folder functions

Plugins (e.g. remote control or scene switching tools) need to know how
scenes are organized in the Scenes dock and should be able to organize
them as well. As the existing scene functions keep returning every
scene regardless of folders, folders are exposed through separate
functions instead:

* obs_frontend_get_scene_folder_names
* obs_frontend_get_scene_folder
* obs_frontend_get_scene_folder_scenes
* obs_frontend_add_scene_folder
* obs_frontend_remove_scene_folder
* obs_frontend_set_scene_folder

OBS_FRONTEND_EVENT_SCENE_FOLDERS_CHANGED is emitted whenever folders are
added, removed or renamed, or scenes are moved into or out of a folder.
---
